CareerSync Semantic Autofill V3 fixes

1. Cleans ATS labels so <select> option lists do not become part of the question.
2. Prefers clean DOM/ARIA labels over polluted scanner labels.
3. Keeps long option lists out of semantic context.
4. A profile/memory value that cannot be inserted into a choice field is passed to AI for semantic adaptation instead of being treated as an extension error.
5. Duplicate Autofill clicks are ignored instead of reported as an error.

Replace extension/content/content.js with the included file, reload the extension, and refresh the job form. Backend files are included unchanged for convenience.
